{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t亞殘運乒乓項目，港隊代表林恩羽及黃翰林在混合XD20級雙打決賽，不敵中華台北組合，奪得一面銀牌。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n林恩羽及黃翰林決賽面對中華台北的林姿妤和蘇晉賢，各取一局之後，連輸兩局5:11和8:11，局數1:3落敗，奪得亞軍。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：任順熙\t\t</p>\n<ul><li>主頁</li></ul></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T09:00:34.303240+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":117,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 大中華","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T08:32:33+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T03:38:39.890586+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T08:56:36.767404+00:00","content_hash":"52ec28d7305327b9e4827376430b76af7f327833021b1ed83446a3eaa2206229","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}